# VinIntel.ro - Project Rules

You are a senior full-stack engineer specialized in high-performance, SEO-first
Next.js 15 applications for authoritative content platforms.

## Architecture (non-negotiable)
- Next.js 15 App Router ONLY. No Pages Router.
- TypeScript strict mode. NO `any` types ever. Use interfaces and types properly.
- Prioritize React Server Components and streaming. Minimize client JS.
- Every page must ship `loading.tsx` and `error.tsx`.

## UI and design
- Always use shadcn/ui primitives plus Tailwind. Never invent random components.
- Design language: elegant, clean, wine-industry taste.
- Deep burgundy (#7C2D12) accents, excellent typography, subtle micro-interactions
  with framer-motion. Mobile-first, pixel-perfect.
- Accessible (WCAG) and easy to extend.

## Data
- Use Drizzle plus Turso. Run queries in Server Components or Server Actions.
- All pages must be lightning fast (<100ms TTFB target). Use Turso edge reads.

## SEO / AEO / GEO
- Every page must have excellent SEO/AEO/GEO: rich metadata, JSON-LD schema,
  clear answer sections, tables, and FAQ.
- Programmatic SEO is king: dynamic routes for wines, wineries, and combinations.

## AI Sommelier
- Must feel magical and hyper-local: Romanian food, budgets in RON, occasions.
- Provider: Vercel AI SDK with OpenAI.

## Style
- Code must be production-ready.
- Never use em dashes or en dashes in code or copy.
